.TH ALARM 3crunch "" "Crunch" "Crunch Library Manual"
.SH NAME
alarm \- schedule a SIGALRM
.SH SYNOPSIS
.nf
.B #include <unistd.h>
.B unsigned int alarm(unsigned int seconds);
.fi
.SH DESCRIPTION
Schedules SIGALRM after seconds, replacing any previous real\-time alarm.
Zero cancels the alarm. alarm and ITIMER_REAL share the same timer.
.SH RETURN VALUE
Returns the seconds remaining on the previous alarm, or zero. errno is unchanged.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR setitimer (3crunch),
.BR alarm (2)
